diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index ea1a1a0..a2a5efd 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -7,6 +7,26 @@ Semantic Versioning.
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Changed
+
+- **Breaking:** v1 `Files.Add` now takes a file name and an `io.Reader`
+  (`Add(ctx, fileName, content, opts...)`) and builds the multipart/form-data
+  body internally, matching `CallLogs.AddRecording`. Associate the upload with
+  deals, persons, organizations, products, activities, leads or projects via
+  the new `WithFileDealID`, `WithFilePersonID`, `WithFileOrganizationID`,
+  `WithFileProductID`, `WithFileActivityID`, `WithFileLeadID` and
+  `WithFileProjectID` options. Previously callers passed a pre-encoded body
+  and Content-Type; use `client.Raw.Do` if you need full control over the
+  request body.
+
+### Fixed
+
+- v1 file uploads via `Files.Add` are now buffered into a replayable
+  multipart body, so the retry transport resends them after 429 (and 5xx,
+  with `RetryAllMethods`) responses. Uploads built from non-rewindable
+  readers such as `*os.File` previously failed immediately on 429 because the
+  request body could not be replayed.
+
 ## [1.11.0] - 2026-08-18
 
 ### Added
